# Jar lid 0: a screw lid (kitchen_lid_gold) upside down on the worktop, 4.2 m across with a rolled rim 0.72 m high: a dish to jump into, a cream gasket
# (kitchen_gasket) round its floor (60 times life size). Knee cover. Mesh collider.
format 1
collider mesh

Detail detail=0.2
    Union
        Material material=kitchen_lid_gold
            Union
                Subtraction
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.36, 0)
                        RoundedCylinder radius=2.1 roundness=0.1 height=0.36
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.72, 0)
                        CappedCylinder radius=1.8 height=0.4
                Translate translation=(0, 0.57, 0)
                    Torus innerRadius=1.8 outerRadius=2.1
        Material material=kitchen_gasket
            Translate translation=(0, 0.34, 0)
                Torus innerRadius=1.2 outerRadius=1.7
